/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Neutron\055Capture\040Elements\040in\040the\040Early\040Galaxy)
/Author (Christopher\040Sneden\054\040John\040J\056\040Cowan\054\040Roberto\040Gallino\054\040Roberto\040Gallino)
/Subject (The\040content\040of\040neutron\055capture\040\050trans\055iron\055peak\051\040elements\040in\040the\040lowmetallicity\040Galactic\040halo\040varies\040widely\040from\040star\040to\040star\056\040The\040differences\040are\040both\040in\040bulk\040amount\040of\040the\040neutron\055capture\040elements\040with\040respect\040to\040lighter\040ones\040and\040in\040element\055to\055element\040ratios\040among\040themselves\056\040Several\040well\055defined\040abundance\040distributions\040have\040emerged\040that\040reveal\040characteristic\040rapid\040and\040slow\040neutron\055capture\040nucleosynthesis\040patterns\056\040In\040this\040review\040we\040summarize\040these\040observed\040metal\055poor\040star\220s\040abundances\054\040contrasting\040them\040with\040the\040Solar\055system\040values\054\040comparing\040them\040to\040theoretical\040predictions\054\040using\040them\040to\040assess\040the\040types\040of\040stars\040responsible\040for\040their\040specific\040anomalies\054\040and\040speculating\040on\040the\040timing\040and\040nature\040of\040early\040Galactic\040nucleosynthesis\056)
/Keywords (15\040Aug\0402008\054\040Annual\040Review\040of\040Astronomy\040and\040Astrophysics\054\040Stellar\040nucleosynthesis\054\040r\055process\054\040Galactic\040halo\054\040Nucleosynthesis\054\040Galactic\040corona\054\040University\040of\040Texas\040at\040Austin\054\040Monash\040University\054\040University\040of\040Turin)
>>
